$realworld_app_footer $mol_view
	dom_name \footer
	sub /
		<= Inner $mol_view
			sub /
				<= Brand $realworld_app_link
					arg *
					sub /
						\conduit
				<= Note $mol_view
					dom_name \span
					sub /
						\An interactive learning project from
						<= Source $mol_link
							uri \https://thinkster.io
							target \_blank
							sub /
								\Thinkster
						\. Code & design licensed under MIT.
